WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.117
Nordic winters are cold and dry: nails break easily and lashes get brittle!

2
00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:11.764
Cuticle oil, gloves, lash care and humidity at home: let's take a look.

3
00:00:11.764 --> 00:00:16.586
Every night, apply cuticle oil to your cuticles and the surface of your nails.

4
00:00:16.586 --> 00:00:21.928
Cuticles stay soft, you get fewer hangnails, and your nails are more flexible.

5
00:00:21.928 --> 00:00:25.083
In the cold, always wear gloves outdoors.

6
00:00:25.083 --> 00:00:29.294
After every hand wash, apply a thin layer of hand cream.

7
00:00:29.294 --> 00:00:34.804
Cold air outside and dry heating inside make lashes dry and brittle too.

8
00:00:34.804 --> 00:00:40.598
Brush them daily, don't blow hot air near your eyes, and don't sit in the sauna for too long.

9
00:00:40.598 --> 00:00:45.616
Heated indoor air is very dry, and a small humidifier helps a lot.

10
00:00:45.616 --> 00:00:51.108
Drink enough water too, and your skin, nails and lashes will dry out less.

11
00:00:51.108 --> 00:00:58.134
In short: cuticle oil every night, gloves outdoors, lash care away from heat, and humidity at home.

12
00:00:58.134 --> 00:01:02.793
Dry nails or lashes after the winter? Book a treatment at Moja Beauty!

13
00:01:02.793 --> 00:01:08.992
